│  sensitive data.\n- **Data Protection**: The project does not handle any     │
│  sensitive data, so no additional security measures are required.\n\n##      │
│  Testing Strategy\n\nThe testing strategy is to ensure that the              │
│  implementation of the arithmetic operations and the command-line interface  │
│  are correct. The test suite will cover all the required functionalities,    │
