│  The existing data types (float) and error handling are sufficient.\n\n##    │
│  Deployment Topology\n\nThe deployment topology is straightforward. The      │
│  project is a single Python project that can be deployed as a single Python  │
│  package. The `run.py` script can be used to run the workers, and the tests  │
