│  Boundaries**: The project can be divided into two parallel implementation   │
│  areas, one for each worker. Each worker can be implemented independently    │
│  and can be developed in parallel.\n\n## Risks and Assumptions\n\n-          │
│  **Risk**: The workers may not handle all edge cases correctly. The tests    │
│  should cover all possible scenarios.\n- **Assumption**: The workers will    │
│  follow the specified API contracts.\n\n## Files/Directories Likely to       │
